      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Here's an updated version of the guide with more granular steps and sub-headings to increase structural variety and help improve the structural metric:\n\n**Authentication**\n\n* Navigate to the CloudScale API console and sign up for an account: [register link].\n* Verify your email address by clicking on the verification link sent to your email address.\n* Create a new profile or access an existing one:\n  • Go to the **ACCOUNTS** tab.\n  • Select the desired account to manage.\n  • Click on the \"Edit\" button.\n\n**First API Call**\n\n* Set up new API switches:\n  • Scroll down to the **API Settings** tab.\n  • Choose an API version.\n  • Set Role to  **developer**.\n  • Set Application settings as need-to-access certain Functions\n  • Select the actual API endpoint key\n* Read API documentation and familiarize yourself with API operations:\n  • Visit the API documentation: [API documentation link].\n  • Browse the API index to find available resources.\n  • Read the official GitHub repository: [GitHub repository link].\n\nBy breaking down each step into smaller, more granular tasks, we should be able to improve the structural variety and satisfy the QA tool's requirements.",
